Scope
-----

This licence covers the source code, the procedural 3D models, the
stylesheets, the build scripts and the descriptive text written for this
project.

It does not cover third-party works bundled here. Photographs are used under
their own Creative Commons licences, the text adapted from Wikipedia is
CC BY-SA 4.0, three.js is MIT and the typefaces are under the SIL Open Font
License. Every one of those is listed, with its licence, in NOTICE.

The full legal code of CC BY-NC 4.0 is not reproduced in this file. Read it
at the URL above. If you redistribute this repository, ship this file, NOTICE
and a link to that legal code together.
